# These paths are fetched and executed on a user's machine: the formulae carry
# the URL and checksum that `brew install` downloads and runs, and install.sh /
# install.ps1 are piped-to-shell installers. A change here needs an owner's
# approval even from someone who already has write access.
#
# Deliberately not `*`, so routine README and docs edits are not gated.
#
# Owners are listed individually rather than as a team, so the rule resolves
# regardless of a team's visibility settings.

/Formula/            @sachmans @karol-blaszczyk
/install.sh          @sachmans @karol-blaszczyk
/install.ps1         @sachmans @karol-blaszczyk
/.github/workflows/  @sachmans @karol-blaszczyk
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @sachmans @karol-blaszczyk
